RF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Multnomah County record runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids July to August came in under 90% of normal in 41 of those 75 years. In 2025, June to July ran 39% of normal on the middle, and April to May ran 54%. Grid 30629 had its driest year in 1985, at 62% of normal.</p>"}
